# Keep the GORMPO MedLlama-8B/MCS tokenizer + token + log artifacts tracked
# (needed to resume this pipeline on another server). "dir/*" above (rather
# than "dir/") is required for these negations to actually re-include nested
# files -- a bare "dir/" excludes the directory itself and git won't
# traverse into it at all, so per-file "!" rules below it would be silently
# ignored. These also override the *.pth/*.npy extension excludes above,
# since the last matching pattern in the file wins.
!forecasting/saved_models/gormpo_tokenizer_mcs_scratch_long2000/
!forecasting/saved_models/gormpo_tokenizer_mcs_scratch_long2000/**
!forecasting/data/gormpo_tokens_mcs_scratch_long2000/
!forecasting/data/gormpo_tokens_mcs_scratch_long2000/**
!forecasting/results_llm/gormpo_mcs_scratch_long2000/
!forecasting/results_llm/gormpo_mcs_scratch_long2000/gormpo_llm_2021.txt
